<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9995.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9995.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9995 against the dollar, up from 3.0035 yesterday and at 1.8380 against the mark, down from 1.8300, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.36 percent from the central weighted dollar and mark parity rates, up from Thursday's 2.33 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
